\
An interactive art piece for Haeckles, London. Neuro Wave is an interactive piece that visualises an open sea and people can manipulate the nature of the sea using their thoughts while meditating.

The idea of the project is to use the metaphor of sea and connect it to the inner calmness. The sea becomes more calm when the EEG levels go down. EEG levels were used as a marker for brain activity.
